    "summary": "A grieving user expresses profound emptiness and a loss of identity following the death of a partner, hinting at passive suicidal ideation (\"waiting for the clock to run out\"). The assistant responds with empathetic validation and repeated attempts to offer support and reassurance of the user's value.",
